{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","name_native":"سنن ابن ماجه","section":{"6":"Chapters Regarding Funerals"},"section_detail":{"6":{"hadithnumber_first":1433,"hadithnumber_last":1637,"arabicnumber_first":1433,"arabicnumber_last":1637,"name_native":"كتاب الجنائز"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1596,"arabicnumber":1596,"text":"حدثنا محمد بن رمح، انبانا الليث بن سعد، عن يزيد بن ابي حبيب، عن سعد بن سنان، عن انس بن مالك، قال: قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم \" انما الصبر عند الصدمة الاولى","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Hasan Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":6,"hadith":164}}]}